The only C or C++ tracked here is twenty test harnesses under
`tools/*_oracle/` and `ensemble/tools/*_oracle/`, which link an upstream to
produce reference numbers the Mojo is checked against; two of those files are
CatBoost's own, redistributed under Apache-2.0 and changed as recorded in
DERIVATION.md. None of the projects below contains any Mojo.

